  "description": "Bridge wire-protocol framing protection surface (ADR-127 §D3 / G19). Four panels: framing rate by (app_protocol, bridge_protocol) / 5m, framing MISMATCH rate (the alert source for FaasBridgeFramingMismatch), active bridge_protocol=h1 count on http2/grpc apps (the surgical-rollback indicator), and bridge H2C handshake latency p99. The mismatch panel pairs with deploy/ansible/roles/prometheus/files/bridge.rules.yml::FaasBridgeFramingMismatch and FaasBridgeRollbackStuck; the runbook lives at docs/ops/h2c-rollback.md.",
  "editable": true,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [],
  "liveNow": false,
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Bridge framing rate by (app_protocol, bridge_protocol) / 5m",
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (app_protocol, bridge_protocol, framing) (rate(vmmd_bridge_framing_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{app_protocol}}/{{bridge_protocol}}/{{framing}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "color": {
            "mode": "palette-classic"
          },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "linear",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 10,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "none",
              "group": "A"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "showLegend": true,
          "calcs": ["mean", "max"]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
